@startuml

participant OpSim
participant Simopsim
participant SIMONA

== Setup ==

SIMONA -> SIMONA: starts SIMONA via cmd
activate SIMONA

SIMONA -> Simopsim: initializes
deactivate SIMONA

activate Simopsim
Simopsim -> OpSim: connects

deactivate Simopsim

== Simulation ==

OpSim -> Simopsim: step at time t with input data
activate Simopsim

Simopsim -> Simopsim: converts input data
Simopsim -> SIMONA: sends input data

activate SIMONA
Simopsim -> SIMONA: requests results

deactivate Simopsim
SIMONA -> Simopsim: result data

deactivate SIMONA
activate Simopsim

Simopsim -> Simopsim: converts result data
Simopsim -> OpSim: return result data

deactivate Simopsim


@enduml